{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22136","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 七 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中秋三五夜，明月在前轩。\n临觞忽不饮，忆我平生欢。\n我有同心人，邈邈崔与钱。\n我有忘形友，迢迢李与元。\n或飞青云上，或落江湖间。\n与我不相见，於今四五年。\n我无缩地术，君非驭风仙。\n安得明月下，四人来晤言。\n良夜信难得，佳期杳无缘。\n明月又不驻，渐下西南天。\n岂无他时会，惜此清景前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}